      ]
    }
  ],
  "known_boundaries": [
    "Reference grammar is not a full LLVM semantic verifier and does not widen text parser or native ABI admission.",
    "Arbitrary named metadata, unsupported nodes/fields, nonempty DIExpression, assembly, operand bundles and unsupported constant operators remain conservative.",
    "Raw constant/metadata text is not rewritten by ConstMerge.",
    "Legacy codegen selection remains default; fixed populations and bypass ratchet stay unchanged.",
    "Fibonacci has zero local whole-program executions; stack allocations still reject."
  ],
